{'query': 'average cost of daily meals per person in India 2024', 'results': [{'title': 'How Much Does a Typical Meal Cost in India? - Detailed Budget ...', 'url': 'https://go-lanka.in/how-much-does-a-typical-meal-cost-in-india-detailed-budget-guide', 'snippet': 'Discover how much a typical meal costs across India, from cheap street snacks to upscale dining, with regional price tables, budgeting tips, and FAQs for savvy travelers.'}, {'title': 'Food Prices in India - Numbeo', 'url': 'https://www.numbeo.com/food-prices/country_result.jsp?country=India', 'snippet': 'Average food prices in India. Various related sociological and economical indexes calculated for India.'}, {'title': 'India Food Prices Dashboard | Daily Retail Food Price Tracker ...', 'url': 'https://foodprices.isignal.in/', 'snippet': '3 hours ago · Track daily retail food prices across India with IndiaSpend’s interactive dashboard. Compare prices of essential commodities like onions, wheat, rice, pulses, and vegetables across states and cities.'}, {'title': 'Meal costs are rising faster than earnings: Data - The Hindu', 'url': 'https://www.thehindu.com/data/meal-costs-are-rising-faster-than-earnings-data/article68796170.ece', 'snippet': 'Oct 28, 2024 · On average, the cost of a healthy meal has increased by 52% in October 2024 compared to the same month last year. Meanwhile, average salaries and wages have increased in the range of 9 to 10%'}, {'title': 'A New Dashboard Shows the Cost of a Healthy Diet Across India', 'url': 'https://thewire.in/food/a-new-dashboard-shows-the-cost-of-a-healthy-diet-across-india', 'snippet': 'Around 40% of the population in rural areas and 10% of the population in cities in India cannot afford two vegetarian meals a day priced at Rs 30 per meal, found an analysis of data...'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 3.194380199944135}
{'query': 'cheap vegetarian dinner recipes with ingredient costs in India', 'results': [{'title': 'Find and save ideas about cheap vegetarian dinner india on Pinterest.', 'url': 'https://www.pinterest.com/ideas/cheap-vegetarian-dinner-india/918893204819/', 'snippet': 'Vegetarian Indian Dinner Ideas.Famous Mix Veg Pulao Recipe – Easy One Pot Indian Rice Dish | Indian rice recipes with vegetables, Vegetable pulau recipe, Vegetable pulao recipe with vegetables.'}, {'title': '58 Cheap Vegetarian Meals (great recipes for students!)', 'url': 'https://hurrythefoodup.com/vegetarian-recipes-for-students/', 'snippet': 'What makes delicious vegetarian recipes cheap and nutritious? There’s no mystery behind these cheap vegetarian recipes, just a few simple things: cooking from scratch without wasting money on processed foods.'}, {'title': 'allrecipes.com/recipes/87/everyday-cooking/vegetarian', 'url': 'https://www.allrecipes.com/recipes/87/everyday-cooking/vegetarian/', 'snippet': 'Vegetarian Recipes 9,045 recipes.'}, {'title': 'On a budget? Try these 12 cheap vegan meals - VegKit.com', 'url': 'https://www.vegkit.com/blog/lifestyle/on-a-budget-try-these-cheap-vegan-meals/', 'snippet': 'Keep costs low and nutritional value high with this nifty recipe for curried veg and flatbread. It’s a match made in cheap-yet-healthy-meal heaven, loaded with plant-based goodness and complex carbohydrates that will leave you feeling fuller for longer.'}, {'title': 'Alberta Cheap Dinners Under $5: $2.50 Skillet | eezly', 'url': 'https://eezly.com/blog/alberta-cheap-dinner-recipes-under-5-budget-meals/', 'snippet': 'The cheapest dinner recipe in this Alberta costing is Vegetable Egg Skillet at $34.93 total for 14 servings, or $2.50 per serving.If you want the fullest recipe with parmesan, herbs, mustard seed, butter, olive oil, and mayonnaise, choose the Vegetarian Patties at $4.68 per serving.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.9636855999706313}
{'query': 'cheap non-vegetarian dinner recipes with ingredient costs in India', 'results': [{'title': 'What Saved Dinner (And My Budget)? These 29 Indian Recipes', 'url': 'https://easyindiancookbook.com/what-saved-dinner-and-my-budget-these-29-indian-recipes/', 'snippet': 'May 25, 2025 · Soft and fluffy, Rava Idli Recipe is a quick fix for when you need dinner on the table fast. It’s an affordable choice that delivers on taste without requiring much effort. With its texture, it’s a go to option for a light yet fulfilling meal. This recipe proves you don’t have to spend much to enjoy a homemade dish. Eggless Banana Pancakes.'}, {'title': 'Cheap Indian Recipes| Hari Ghotra', 'url': 'https://www.harighotra.co.uk/indian-recipes/dish-type/cheap', 'snippet': 'Once you have stocked your cupboard with the essential herbs and spices, you’re already halfway to creating delicious Indian dishes. We all need cheap meal ideas to get us through the week and I’m positive you’ll find some enticing and filling recipes to inspire you as you browse these recipe pages.'}, {'title': 'Indian Non Veg Recipes Recipes - Easy Indian Non Veg Recipes ...', 'url': 'https://www.archanaskitchen.com/category/recipes/indian/main-course/indian-non-veg-recipes', 'snippet': 'In this section you will find recipes from the classic chicken butter masala, tandoori chicken, chettinad chicken, pepper chicken, kerala fried fish and more. From traditional favorites to modern twists, explore our collection of Indian Non Veg recipes perfect for home cooking.'}, {'title': '37 Cheap and Easy Curry Recipes: Delicious Dinners on a Budget -', 'url': 'https://mymoneycottage.com/37-cheap-and-easy-curry-recipes-delicious-dinners-on-a-budget/', 'snippet': 'Jul 25, 2024 · Discover 37 cheap and easy curry recipes that are delicious, budget-friendly, and simple to make. Perfect for flavorful dinners without breaking the bank!'}, {'title': 'Non-vegetarian Recipes | 125 Indian Meat Recipes', 'url': 'https://www.indianhealthyrecipes.com/recipes/non-veg/', 'snippet': 'Non-Vegetarian Recipes from Indian Cuisine. Here you will find all Indian meat recipes shared on this blog. These are popular.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.893753599957563}
{'query': 'budget-friendly breakfast and lunch recipes for one person in India', 'results': [{'title': '7 Indian Meals Under ₹150: Budget-Friendly Ideas', 'url': 'https://craftmymeals.com/articles/healthy-indian-meals-under-150-rupees', 'snippet': 'May 31, 2026 · Seven Indian meal ideas built around affordable staples such as dal, eggs, seasonal vegetables and grains, with a practical ₹150 budget reference.'}, {'title': 'Indian meal plan for one person - Listonic', 'url': 'https://listonic.com/meal-plans/en/indian-meal-plan-for-one-person', 'snippet': 'Oct 1, 2024 · Choosing the Indian meal plan for one person can make meal prep easy and enjoyable. This plan includes simple, single-serving recipes that are quick to prepare, minimizing waste and effort.'}, {'title': 'How To Cook Delicious Indian Meals For One Without Burning ...', 'url': 'https://food.ndtv.com/how-to/how-to-cook-delicious-indian-meals-for-one-without-burning-through-your-budget-8765548', 'snippet': 'Jun 26, 2025 · Whether you are done with instant noodles or simply craving something homemade that will not blow your budget, here is your guide to clever, budget-conscious solo meal planning.'}, {'title': '131 Quick Indian Breakfast Recipes by Tarla Dalal', 'url': 'https://www.tarladalal.com/recipes-for-quick-breakfast-indian-328', 'snippet': 'May 4, 2026 · Explore 131 quick Indian breakfast recipes like batata poha, methi thepla, and upma. Easy veg ideas by Tarla Dalal for busy mornings – healthy and delicious!'}, {'title': 'Healthy Weekly Meal Plan: Nutritious And Delicious Indian Recipes', 'url': 'https://fitelo.co/diet/healthy-weekly-meal-plan/', 'snippet': 'Discover an affordable and healthy weekly meal plan tailored for the Indian diet, balancing nutrition, taste, and cost for a healthier you! We all know that healthy eating is vital, but let’s be practical- it feels like a challenge, especially when you’re trying to be on a budget.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 3.5329948000144213}
